{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful exorcism, the priests trapped your demonic soul inside a stick and cast you back into Hell. You awaken at the very bottom determined to climb your way back to Dad's throne to ask him to turn you back into a demon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.poster.avif?t=1762935816\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.webm?t=1762935816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.mp4?t=1762935816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a rage game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stick, you\u2019ll navigate through the twisted layers of Hell, each inspired by the haunting and surreal visions of Hieronymus Bosch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>simple controls</strong> to master <strong>precise movement</strong>, solve <strong>punishing physics challenges</strong>, and endure <strong>endless falls</strong> as you fight your way upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake will send you tumbling back down. Every success will feel like a miracle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/8b6c0794c5f00cf047c1612377fb87cf.poster.avif?t=1762935816\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/8b6c0794c5f00cf047c1612377fb87cf.webm?t=1762935816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/8b6c0794c5f00cf047c1612377fb87cf.mp4?t=1762935816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In This Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments inspired by the paintings of Hieronymus Bosch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mechanics, unforgiving difficulty</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play through two of the Hell levels, while 9 levels of Hell with different mechanics awaits you in full game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4156200?t=1762935816","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/4cf2b2e6ad7a03e1c407e1fa6f838da1494320dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762935816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/7c047ad1710e3ca01a387bda97687bda3ae72c18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762935816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/7c047ad1710e3ca01a387bda97687bda3ae72c18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762935816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a successful exorcism, the priests trapped your demonic soul inside a stick and cast you back into Hell. You awaken at the very bottom determined to climb your way back to Dad's throne to ask him to turn you back into a demon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156200/extras/62db203c50ed9670a0ac9c9bd09cb2e6.poster.avif?t=1762935816\" width=616 hei